WEBVTT

00:29.112 --> 00:30.197
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:33.283 --> 00:34.909
CHARACTERS, EVENTS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND PLACES IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:34.910 --> 00:36.203
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

01:35.012 --> 01:37.806
But why would you say liking me

01:38.849 --> 01:40.517
is being greedy?

01:41.101 --> 01:42.603
Because you'll go back soon?

01:43.395 --> 01:45.439
It doesn't matter if I'm being greedy now.

01:47.899 --> 01:49.568
I can't stop my feelings anyway.

01:52.612 --> 01:54.238
So I'll just keep going,

01:54.239 --> 01:56.783
because I don't want
to waste our time together.

01:59.619 --> 02:02.622
Then don't say
you're being greedy anymore.

02:03.165 --> 02:04.458
If you say that again,

02:05.375 --> 02:06.793
I won't let it slide.

02:08.253 --> 02:09.629
I should be careful, then.

02:14.468 --> 02:16.261
EPISODE 8

02:18.138 --> 02:20.056
Stop staring at it.

02:20.057 --> 02:21.850
It won't even be visible tomorrow.

02:23.268 --> 02:26.062
Oh. And make sure to call your grandma.

02:26.063 --> 02:28.440
She'll be worried sick
after you left like that.

02:29.524 --> 02:31.610
I will.

02:34.655 --> 02:36.531
I used to be just like that watch.

02:37.991 --> 02:41.995
I was frozen in time,
but someone made time move again for me.

02:42.621 --> 02:43.705
Like this.

02:49.252 --> 02:53.799
So how about letting time with your dad
start moving again?

02:58.428 --> 03:00.097
The past is the past.

03:00.639 --> 03:01.682
What's important

03:02.766 --> 03:04.476
is the time that will flow from now on.

03:27.290 --> 03:29.583
Her boyfriend died back then.

03:29.584 --> 03:32.670
He went to study in Boston,
but he suddenly died.

03:32.671 --> 03:33.879
Hey, roomie.

03:33.880 --> 03:37.801
The fact that I lived
while he died from that accident…

03:38.635 --> 03:40.220
It's a good thing you took it out.

03:41.096 --> 03:44.515
I want someone to have joy in their life.

03:44.516 --> 03:48.061
She was a grateful disruption
that made me live again.

03:51.898 --> 03:53.525
Mr. Park, we…

03:54.276 --> 03:56.361
Of course. I know.

04:04.786 --> 04:06.329
Take her home safely.

04:07.873 --> 04:10.000
Let's go, Genius.

04:30.937 --> 04:31.938
Go on in.

04:34.816 --> 04:36.025
Bye.

04:38.445 --> 04:40.613
Look forward.

04:40.614 --> 04:42.698
It'll be dangerous
if you fall down the hill.

04:48.538 --> 04:50.081
I'm relieved.

04:51.249 --> 04:52.250
You're warm.

04:53.126 --> 04:54.544
It's just that…

04:55.670 --> 04:56.880
this feels like a dream.

04:58.381 --> 04:59.800
I can't believe it.

05:09.100 --> 05:10.768
Should I make this feel more real?

05:10.769 --> 05:12.144
No, thanks.

05:13.897 --> 05:15.732
I'll go now. Head inside.

05:16.316 --> 05:17.359
Get back safely.

05:35.502 --> 05:36.545
What a relief.

05:45.762 --> 05:48.264
Now, now.

05:48.265 --> 05:50.475
You didn't take your meds again?

05:52.060 --> 05:55.062
I told you to take them on time.

05:55.063 --> 05:57.690
Let's go to the hospital this week.

05:57.691 --> 06:01.278
Keep your cardiac enzyme
test results in your wallet

06:02.153 --> 06:05.699
so someone can see it if you ever collapse
when you're not with me.

06:06.324 --> 06:07.325
We have to go, okay?

06:07.951 --> 06:11.287
Just think of me as a nagging son,

06:11.288 --> 06:13.373
and come with me.

06:14.291 --> 06:15.624
All right.

06:15.625 --> 06:16.751
And you

06:17.419 --> 06:20.130
should think of me
as a father who listens to you,

06:20.755 --> 06:22.591
so tell me anything

06:23.550 --> 06:25.926
that you have a hard time
telling anyone else.

06:25.927 --> 06:28.054
You can tell me
anything that troubles you.

06:29.806 --> 06:31.725
I'll be your safe space.

06:34.603 --> 06:37.605
I wasn't trying to hide
my relationship with Ms. Song…

06:37.606 --> 06:39.024
You really like her, right?

06:43.528 --> 06:45.155
- Yes.
- All right.

06:45.989 --> 06:50.409
Let her feel joy again.

06:50.410 --> 06:55.289
You don't need a reason
to want someone to be happy.

06:55.290 --> 06:58.668
As long as you're sincere, it's okay.

07:05.925 --> 07:07.969
Ms. Song,
there's an international delivery.

07:13.975 --> 07:14.976
Wow.

07:17.020 --> 07:19.438
I finally got the sketch sample
for my design.

07:19.439 --> 07:20.690
Make some noise!

07:23.276 --> 07:24.861
It's all thanks to this pen.

07:35.914 --> 07:38.792
But how did you come up
with the idea of sending me a pen?

07:41.836 --> 07:45.256
I kept thinking about how you said
you felt like you were trapped.

07:48.551 --> 07:50.095
I used to feel that way, too.

07:51.262 --> 07:54.474
Back then, I kept thinking the same thing.

08:00.105 --> 08:01.398
If…

08:02.065 --> 08:04.901
there was just a small crack
to breathe through, I could live.

08:06.569 --> 08:07.570
But…

08:08.071 --> 08:11.074
that "if" never came true for me.

08:12.450 --> 08:14.326
I guess I wanted

08:14.327 --> 08:16.496
that pen to be that "if" for you.

08:19.040 --> 08:21.459
Chan understands me so well…

08:23.336 --> 08:25.672
Sorry, I was rambling.

08:26.881 --> 08:28.091
I should go now.

08:39.060 --> 08:40.854
-  Great work today.
-  You too.

08:41.938 --> 08:44.314
- I'm going back to Korea first.
- Okay, sure.

08:54.242 --> 08:57.453
Maybe it's because I lost
the pen I used for seven years,

08:57.454 --> 09:00.081
but I couldn't sketch anything
during the two days here.

09:01.041 --> 09:03.792
Yes, seven years ago. Early July.

09:03.793 --> 09:06.045
And the engraving is Haran.

09:06.046 --> 09:07.337
One second.

09:07.338 --> 09:11.509
Uh, yeah. We have the model name
and the engraving design on file.

09:23.354 --> 09:24.939
The past is the past.

09:26.024 --> 09:27.400
What's important…

09:33.198 --> 09:35.158
is the time
that will flow from now on.

09:41.206 --> 09:43.124
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

09:45.543 --> 09:46.710
Grandma.

09:47.962 --> 09:50.047
Where have you been?

09:50.048 --> 09:51.799
I was at a meeting.

09:51.800 --> 09:53.258
Our dinner ended late.

09:53.259 --> 09:54.886
A meeting dressed like this?

09:55.720 --> 09:57.221
And what's this…

09:57.222 --> 09:58.264
I'll do it.

09:58.807 --> 10:00.517
I'm tired. I'm going to bed.

10:01.893 --> 10:03.477
Grandma, did you go to Seongsu…

10:03.478 --> 10:05.896
I'm sorry, but just let this go for now.

10:05.897 --> 10:07.023
Please.

10:08.817 --> 10:09.859
What?

10:10.902 --> 10:12.194
I just…

10:12.195 --> 10:15.781
thought we haven't been
talking much lately.

10:15.782 --> 10:18.159
Are you sure nothing's wrong?

10:18.785 --> 10:21.662
What's wrong is you asking questions
when I'm so sleepy.

10:21.663 --> 10:23.206
Go to bed.

10:23.873 --> 10:26.126
All right. Good night.

10:32.507 --> 10:33.925
Why are her shoes like that?

10:35.885 --> 10:37.428
It couldn't have been a meeting.

10:40.056 --> 10:41.558
Where in the world was she?

10:54.320 --> 10:57.407
EXAMINATION

11:17.802 --> 11:19.262
The door is closing.

11:20.013 --> 11:22.014
Let me get on!

11:22.015 --> 11:23.515
Thank you.

11:34.235 --> 11:35.444
What's that?

11:35.445 --> 11:38.363
He's the definition of neatness,
and he's got bedhead?

11:38.364 --> 11:40.700
Okay,
I'll check and email you.

11:47.790 --> 11:50.668
He's late and has bedhead? Mr. Yeon?

11:51.836 --> 11:54.379
What's going on?
That doesn't suit him at all.

11:55.465 --> 11:57.090
Look. Isn't it crazy?

11:57.091 --> 11:58.759
- This is insane.
- Is this for real?

11:58.760 --> 12:00.302
Sorry! What are you up to?

12:00.303 --> 12:03.055
Hayeong! Seunggyu took a rare photo.

12:03.056 --> 12:04.431
What photo?

12:04.432 --> 12:07.434
I was organizing the photos
I took during my trend research…

12:07.435 --> 12:09.478
and I was shocked.

12:09.479 --> 12:11.773
That stiff, uptight Mr. Yeon is dating?

12:12.482 --> 12:16.026
This is crazy!

12:16.027 --> 12:18.654
But they look so good together.

12:18.655 --> 12:19.738
They do.

12:21.658 --> 12:22.742
How shameless.

12:23.451 --> 12:25.410
Why is she being so loud when she's late?

12:25.411 --> 12:27.622
Hey, look.

12:30.917 --> 12:32.669
She's the head of La Mode Eclat,

12:33.253 --> 12:35.963
and that's the co-head and her husband.

12:35.964 --> 12:38.173
Oh, geez.

12:38.174 --> 12:40.884
Seunggyu! They were just having
a business meeting.

12:40.885 --> 12:44.513
So they were the heads
of La Mode Eclat.

12:46.557 --> 12:49.143
Sorry about that.

12:51.271 --> 12:53.563
Oh, dear. Why is she suddenly whistling?

12:53.564 --> 12:55.190
There's no in-between with her.

12:56.859 --> 12:57.860
He's right.

12:58.528 --> 12:59.821
Why am I relieved?

13:00.780 --> 13:02.072
But I wonder if Mr. Yeon

13:02.073 --> 13:04.700
would still have that default expression
when he's dating.

13:04.701 --> 13:07.077
No way. I'm sure he'll be different.

13:07.078 --> 13:11.791
He might be
really sweet to the woman he likes.

13:12.375 --> 13:14.418
Sweet?

13:22.510 --> 13:23.593
Your hand.

13:23.594 --> 13:25.555
You might slip
since you're wearing heels.

13:28.725 --> 13:32.394
This happened to my friend,

13:32.395 --> 13:33.562
uh…

13:33.563 --> 13:35.897
but this guy

13:35.898 --> 13:40.068
brushed off dry leaves in the dirt
with his bare hands so she wouldn't slip.

13:40.069 --> 13:41.778
What does that mean?

13:41.779 --> 13:42.947
With his bare hands?

13:43.531 --> 13:44.614
That's love.

13:44.615 --> 13:45.783
Love?

13:46.701 --> 13:49.995
Then if the woman cried,

13:49.996 --> 13:53.331
and he looked at her with pity
and wiped her tears with his hand,

13:53.332 --> 13:55.208
what does that mean?

13:56.919 --> 13:58.003
Love.

13:58.004 --> 13:59.921
He loves me?

13:59.922 --> 14:02.632
And the fact that
you're overanalyzing his every move

14:02.633 --> 14:04.593
means you like him too.

14:04.594 --> 14:06.636
No, that wasn't about me.

14:06.637 --> 14:07.929
That was my friend.

14:07.930 --> 14:09.389
It's obvious it was about you.

14:09.390 --> 14:12.142
My friend told me during a school reunion.

14:12.143 --> 14:13.226
You liar.

14:13.227 --> 14:14.270
Ms. Song Hayeong.

14:16.064 --> 14:18.065
- The new material you mentioned…
-  Ah.

14:18.066 --> 14:20.151
Uh… Mmm…

14:23.529 --> 14:24.863
Hello?

14:24.864 --> 14:26.531
Yes, hello.

14:26.532 --> 14:29.076
I just got an urgent call.

14:29.077 --> 14:30.619
Are you busy right now?

14:30.620 --> 14:31.621
I'm busy too.

14:38.044 --> 14:39.962
What should I say when I give this to her?

14:48.387 --> 14:49.472
Hmm?

14:53.768 --> 14:56.229
Hey, you said
you're coming in the evening.

14:56.896 --> 14:58.271
I'm meeting someone here.

14:58.272 --> 14:59.898
Goodness.

14:59.899 --> 15:01.191
You mean with me?

15:02.735 --> 15:04.319
She's meeting me!

15:04.320 --> 15:07.572
- Hmm?
- What? This is so sudden.

15:07.573 --> 15:10.075
Something came up,
so she's returning to Mungyeong today.

15:10.076 --> 15:12.495
Wow. You were going to meet without me?

15:12.995 --> 15:14.913
- You're always leaving me out.
-  Right.

15:16.958 --> 15:18.708
He's sulking.

15:18.709 --> 15:20.169
This place looks nice.

15:25.550 --> 15:26.759
Wow.

15:27.468 --> 15:30.179
It's shattered and cracked.

15:31.597 --> 15:34.183
And there seem to be
some pieces missing. Hmm?

15:35.768 --> 15:36.769
Will it be too hard?

15:43.234 --> 15:45.110
I can make it work.

15:47.113 --> 15:48.488
It may take some time,

15:48.489 --> 15:51.908
but as long as we don't give up,
it can be fixed somehow.

15:53.244 --> 15:55.287
It would be different from the original,

15:55.288 --> 15:57.664
but let's think of it
as making it stronger.

15:57.665 --> 15:59.624
Thank you so much.

15:59.625 --> 16:01.585
Here's your coffee.

16:03.087 --> 16:06.048
My grandson must be troubling you a lot.

16:06.757 --> 16:09.634
If he does anything to irritate you,

16:09.635 --> 16:13.138
you can just smack him on the back
and kick him out.

16:13.139 --> 16:14.598
Really?

16:14.599 --> 16:18.352
He's been nagging me so much lately
that I've been thinking about it.

16:19.061 --> 16:21.396
I will keep that in mind.

16:22.565 --> 16:24.774
Stop it.

16:24.775 --> 16:28.486
You must be curious about the house.
You can take a look after you're done.

16:28.487 --> 16:31.823
No, it's your private space. I shouldn't…

16:31.824 --> 16:34.159
It's fine. It's also Chan's house.

16:34.160 --> 16:35.369
Give her a tour later.

16:36.621 --> 16:41.459
Seeing you stay with someone so nice
makes me feel at ease.

16:43.502 --> 16:45.503
Be good to him, all right?

16:45.504 --> 16:46.547
I will.

16:48.299 --> 16:50.927
Wow.

16:58.643 --> 17:02.271
So how about letting time with your dad
start moving again?

17:08.361 --> 17:09.362
Chan.

17:11.781 --> 17:13.324
It's nothing. Never mind.

17:14.075 --> 17:16.911
It was nothing.

17:20.289 --> 17:22.333
When will you visit again?

17:23.209 --> 17:25.335
That little brat isn't even seeing me off.

17:25.336 --> 17:26.503
I should give him a smack.

17:26.504 --> 17:27.713
Grandma.

17:28.589 --> 17:30.132
Can you drop me off on the way?

17:31.634 --> 17:32.718
Where?

17:33.302 --> 17:34.386
Daejeon.

17:37.807 --> 17:39.850
I don't know what I'll do there,

17:40.601 --> 17:42.979
but I think
I should at least give this back to him.

17:44.939 --> 17:45.940
Mm.

17:57.535 --> 17:59.202
I saw Yougyum this weekend.

17:59.203 --> 18:01.330
He was going to karaoke with his friends.

18:05.376 --> 18:07.086
Are you having
a lot of fun these days?

18:07.587 --> 18:09.380
Did you have fun at karaoke?

18:10.923 --> 18:12.757
What? I…

18:17.597 --> 18:19.599
Yeah, I had fun.

18:20.266 --> 18:22.143
You seemed to be having fun, too.

18:22.977 --> 18:25.563
You gave Seokhyeon
a drink with a heart on it.

18:26.272 --> 18:27.355
What?

18:28.566 --> 18:29.567
So you saw it.

18:29.984 --> 18:31.443
Yeah, I'm happy these days.

18:31.444 --> 18:33.486
I'm really glad to hear that.

18:33.487 --> 18:35.990
Yeah, so let's both live happy lives.

18:42.830 --> 18:45.583
CHEMICAL AND BIOLOGICAL ENGINEERING
PROFESSOR SUNWOO SEOK

19:03.059 --> 19:04.101
May I help you?

19:05.519 --> 19:08.104
Oh. I'm here to see Professor Sunwoo.

19:08.105 --> 19:09.522
Ah.

19:09.523 --> 19:11.191
He's gone to the president's office.

19:11.192 --> 19:13.694
May I ask what you're here for?

19:16.113 --> 19:17.448
We're family.

19:18.407 --> 19:20.701
- If he's not here--
- He'll probably be back soon.

19:21.118 --> 19:22.328
Why don't you wait inside?

19:22.620 --> 19:24.120
Ah…

19:45.559 --> 19:47.560
He's taking a while.

19:47.561 --> 19:48.729
Should I try calling him?

19:50.189 --> 19:52.233
No, I'll just go.

19:52.900 --> 19:56.570
Would it be okay
to leave this here?

19:57.113 --> 19:58.239
Sure, go ahead.

20:08.708 --> 20:11.585
KOREA SCIENCE UNIVERSITY

20:14.338 --> 20:16.172
Let me keep this, Dad.

20:44.452 --> 20:46.202
How long are you going to keep doing this?

20:46.203 --> 20:48.873
What more do I have to do
to make you stop?

21:33.876 --> 21:35.461
Excuse me, you said you're family.

21:36.045 --> 21:39.882
Are you his son who's working
as an animator in the US?

21:40.382 --> 21:41.383
You are, right?

21:41.967 --> 21:44.011
I heard a lot about you
from Professor Sunwoo.

21:44.512 --> 21:47.055
He always rushes to see
any movies that get released.

21:47.056 --> 21:49.475
He even buys tickets for his students.

22:05.574 --> 22:07.075
Can I ask you something, sir?

22:07.076 --> 22:09.787
I heard there's a famous bakery nearby.

22:10.287 --> 22:11.497
Do you know where it is?

22:13.082 --> 22:14.791
Excuse me?

22:14.792 --> 22:16.417
I came here to buy bread.

22:16.418 --> 22:19.088
I heard there's
a really famous bakery here.

22:21.257 --> 22:23.676
You're such a bad liar.

22:24.301 --> 22:26.928
Were you worried
something would've happened again?

22:26.929 --> 22:28.346
Well…

22:28.347 --> 22:30.640
I also came to check
Daejeon's fashion trends.

22:30.641 --> 22:31.724
Wow.

22:31.725 --> 22:33.978
Everyone's so fashionable here.

22:36.230 --> 22:39.732
And I thought that if anything happened,

22:39.733 --> 22:41.609
I could give you a hug.

22:41.610 --> 22:43.946
Look at you.

22:44.864 --> 22:48.117
When going to Gyeongju,
at the airport, and now Daejeon…

22:48.868 --> 22:51.245
You keep surprising me like this.

22:51.954 --> 22:53.914
You'll make me get my hopes up.

22:55.708 --> 22:58.752
I'll keep thinking you'll appear anywhere.

23:01.714 --> 23:02.715
Fine.

23:03.299 --> 23:06.594
I'll appear anywhere you are,
so you can get your hopes up.

23:09.722 --> 23:10.723
Seonu Chan!

23:34.038 --> 23:37.166
I'm so glad you've recovered.

23:38.000 --> 23:41.127
Professor Sunwoo gave up on his research
just before presenting it

23:41.128 --> 23:45.298
to go take care of you in America
when you were badly injured.

23:45.299 --> 23:46.799
We've done everything we can.

23:46.800 --> 23:49.093
Now we just have to hope
that he'll pull through.

23:49.094 --> 23:50.803
The truth is, you should be aware

23:50.804 --> 23:52.513
it's not very likely that he'll wake up.

24:16.664 --> 24:17.665
Thanks…

24:18.540 --> 24:19.750
for the watch.

24:24.463 --> 24:27.967
Maybe you should return your degree.

24:29.510 --> 24:32.930
A famous engineering professor
can't even fix a broken watch?

24:34.223 --> 24:36.725
It's working well now.

24:38.352 --> 24:39.436
Thank you…

24:40.521 --> 24:41.563
for fixing it.

24:45.859 --> 24:47.069
If you're grateful,

24:49.154 --> 24:51.740
you can pay me back later.

25:51.967 --> 25:53.886
Grandma called.

25:54.344 --> 25:56.054
She thanked me and said I did well.

25:56.055 --> 25:57.056
Really?

25:57.765 --> 25:58.807
That's great.

25:59.349 --> 26:02.351
I'm so glad you gave it back to him.

26:02.352 --> 26:05.481
That watch must be
dozens of times more precious now.

26:06.023 --> 26:08.775
It could have ended
with him being sad about losing it,

26:08.776 --> 26:12.571
but now, it's the watch that his son
fixed and returned to him.

26:23.665 --> 26:26.085
Can I see you for a moment again?

26:29.838 --> 26:30.839
Huh?

26:33.550 --> 26:34.926
How did you…

26:34.927 --> 26:38.097
Remember when we went to that restaurant?

26:38.889 --> 26:41.183
When I was in bad shape because of my ear.

26:43.977 --> 26:46.188
It's noisy in there.
I'll go bring our stuff.

26:46.647 --> 26:49.817
It must have gotten mixed up
in my stuff back then.

26:50.776 --> 26:53.070
I found it
when I unpacked my luggage here.

26:53.946 --> 26:54.947
Ah…

26:58.408 --> 27:00.702
I don't need it anymore, though.

27:06.458 --> 27:08.043
I'm already using a different one.

27:08.502 --> 27:10.795
Plus, I have dozens of pens now.

27:10.796 --> 27:13.549
Someone gave me a whole bunch
as a gift.

27:16.218 --> 27:18.136
That's why I'm giving it back now.

27:18.137 --> 27:19.179
I…

27:20.222 --> 27:22.266
was worried that I'd remind you

27:23.183 --> 27:25.477
of the memories back then.

27:26.311 --> 27:28.438
But I thought you wouldn't be wavered now.

27:29.898 --> 27:33.694
Just think of it as a pen
that's the most effective and use it.

27:35.237 --> 27:39.532
I know how important it is
to have a tool that fits you just right

27:39.533 --> 27:41.368
since I'm an animator.

27:42.536 --> 27:45.163
I can just get used to this pen.

27:48.792 --> 27:50.502
Let me borrow this for a second.

28:09.646 --> 28:11.732
Just consider this pen

28:12.441 --> 28:15.444
a pen that I found for you,
not a pen that you got as a gift

28:17.195 --> 28:20.198
or a pen that made you sad
when you lost it.

28:21.742 --> 28:25.244
And… here's a lucky charm.

28:25.245 --> 28:28.248
You know you'll get lucky
once you see an iridescent cloud.

28:28.957 --> 28:30.667
You can see one every day now,

28:31.251 --> 28:34.129
so you'll be lucky every day.

28:42.304 --> 28:43.430
Just use it.

28:46.058 --> 28:49.227
I sincerely want you to use it again.

28:53.774 --> 28:54.775
All right.

28:56.068 --> 28:57.361
I will.

29:00.030 --> 29:01.907
It's the pen you found for me now.

29:20.300 --> 29:21.510
Hello?

29:24.429 --> 29:25.430
Really?

29:26.848 --> 29:28.849
All right.

29:28.850 --> 29:30.727
Thank you. Okay.

29:34.231 --> 29:35.565
No way.

29:36.483 --> 29:38.651
- This is crazy.
- What is it?

29:38.652 --> 29:40.320
Something good really happened.

29:40.988 --> 29:42.655
I'm receiving an award.

29:42.656 --> 29:44.741
The Best Designer Award
at the Fashion Awards.

29:45.367 --> 29:47.410
See? I told you that you'd be lucky.

29:47.411 --> 29:49.621
Congratulations.

30:04.594 --> 30:05.971
Genius.

30:07.472 --> 30:08.931
Are you here?

30:08.932 --> 30:09.933
Huh?

30:11.101 --> 30:12.102
Hey, Genius.

30:15.313 --> 30:16.523
Is there something there?

30:18.650 --> 30:20.068
What…

30:20.902 --> 30:21.986
Nabong!

30:23.280 --> 30:25.406
What are you doing here at this hour?

30:25.407 --> 30:26.491
Hey, Manjae.

30:26.992 --> 30:30.661
I wanted to get a cup of coffee
after I finished work,

30:30.662 --> 30:32.330
but I didn't realize it was so late.

30:34.041 --> 30:37.251
The snow was beautiful,
so I was watching it for a bit.

30:37.252 --> 30:38.961
It's so late…

30:38.962 --> 30:40.881
And you're dressed so lightly.

30:41.339 --> 30:42.423
It's cold.

30:42.424 --> 30:43.675
Come on, let's go inside.

30:45.927 --> 30:47.262
Get yourself warmed up.

30:49.848 --> 30:52.224
What on earth is going on?

30:52.225 --> 30:55.145
I was so absorbed in work,
I didn't notice the time.

30:55.771 --> 30:57.939
You know how focused I can get.

31:02.402 --> 31:03.820
Are you sure nothing's wrong?

31:07.324 --> 31:08.783
Is everything really okay?

31:08.784 --> 31:10.786
Is this some trending challenge?

31:11.286 --> 31:13.789
Why is everyone asking me that?

31:14.956 --> 31:18.168
Did I neglect my skincare
because I was too busy?

31:27.594 --> 31:30.055
Have some warm tea.

31:48.323 --> 31:49.574
What on earth

31:50.367 --> 31:52.619
is going on with you?

32:07.259 --> 32:09.386
LAUNDRY DETERGENT
LAVENDER

32:11.471 --> 32:13.347
Aren't you my Hadam?

32:16.935 --> 32:18.103
It's me.

32:19.354 --> 32:21.022
Mom.

32:22.315 --> 32:23.650
Mom?

32:24.818 --> 32:26.110
Oh, my goodness!

32:26.111 --> 32:28.320
I finally got to meet you.

32:28.321 --> 32:30.114
I wanted to see you so much.

32:30.115 --> 32:32.908
It's me, Yougyum's mom.

32:32.909 --> 32:34.578
What? Ah…

32:35.704 --> 32:36.705
Ah!

32:37.539 --> 32:38.789
Hello.

32:38.790 --> 32:41.000
Goodness, it's so nice to meet you.

32:41.001 --> 32:42.835
I recognized you right away.

32:42.836 --> 32:45.921
Our house is plastered with photos of you.

32:45.922 --> 32:48.966
I feel like I'm meeting a celebrity.

32:48.967 --> 32:52.888
If it's all right, could I give you a hug?

32:57.309 --> 33:00.269
My dear Hadam.

33:00.270 --> 33:03.564
It's so nice to see you.

33:11.489 --> 33:13.909
What's wrong? What is it?

33:14.743 --> 33:19.955
♪ Sleep well, dear Hadam ♪

33:19.956 --> 33:24.293
♪ Sleep in Mommy's arms ♪

33:24.294 --> 33:29.299
♪ Sleep well, dear Hadam ♪

33:29.799 --> 33:34.178
♪ Sleep tight ♪

33:34.179 --> 33:35.347
I found…

33:39.517 --> 33:40.810
Mom's smell.

33:55.784 --> 33:58.078
Come on. I'll make you a meal.

33:59.246 --> 34:01.748
Let's go.

34:02.540 --> 34:04.083
Excuse me.

34:04.084 --> 34:05.709
Where is the grocery store?

34:07.003 --> 34:08.462
Excuse me.

34:08.463 --> 34:10.089
Where is the grocery store?

34:10.090 --> 34:12.841
-  Honey.
- Come on in.

34:16.054 --> 34:17.305
Hello.

34:17.931 --> 34:19.265
Look who it is!

34:19.266 --> 34:20.933
Isn't she our superstar?

34:20.934 --> 34:22.810
- Our dear Hadam.
- Ah…

34:22.811 --> 34:24.520
We told Yougyum to bring you,

34:24.521 --> 34:26.730
but he said
we shouldn't bother your studies

34:26.731 --> 34:29.400
and kept you hidden all along.

34:29.401 --> 34:31.318
I ran into her by chance
at the supermarket.

34:31.319 --> 34:33.070
Welcome.

34:33.071 --> 34:34.238
Did you eat?

34:34.239 --> 34:35.489
Join us for a meal.

34:36.700 --> 34:40.286
Gosh. I told you to bring me
when you're buying heavy stuff.

34:40.287 --> 34:42.579
I'll bring these upstairs.

34:42.580 --> 34:43.914
Gosh!

34:43.915 --> 34:45.250
My goodness.

34:49.212 --> 34:52.424
I can't believe him.

34:57.345 --> 34:59.556
LET'S BE SOMEONE HADAM WILL BE PROUD OF!

35:00.432 --> 35:02.809
I wondered why
he only got perfect scores in English.

35:03.268 --> 35:05.561
I heard you told him in your first year.

35:05.562 --> 35:07.229
The Major League?

35:07.230 --> 35:08.856
If that's your goal,

35:08.857 --> 35:11.817
shouldn't you at least
study English in advance?

35:11.818 --> 35:14.362
I want to be better
than I was yesterday.

35:14.696 --> 35:15.697
"Challenge."

35:16.031 --> 35:17.114
Challenge.

35:17.115 --> 35:20.242
Since then,
his father has been studying English, too.

35:20.243 --> 35:22.328
He said he wants to help Yougyum.

35:22.329 --> 35:25.080
This is how much influence
you have over our family.

35:27.500 --> 35:29.084
He's unbelievable.

35:29.085 --> 35:31.754
Honey, should I braise the fish?

35:31.755 --> 35:33.005
Hang on.

35:33.006 --> 35:34.716
- Sorry. Take a look around.
- Okay.

35:39.346 --> 35:43.098
But how did you end up dating Yougyum?

35:43.099 --> 35:46.143
He said he had a crush on you
since elementary school.

35:46.144 --> 35:48.605
Thinking back,

35:49.105 --> 35:51.649
he was the only one who understood me.

35:53.568 --> 35:55.944
Why aren't your parents
here for the field day?

35:55.945 --> 35:59.531
Hey, she's the poor kid
whose parents both died.

35:59.532 --> 36:01.116
Really? That's so pitiful.

36:01.117 --> 36:05.162
Hey, having your parents
pass away isn't pitiful.

36:05.163 --> 36:06.373
It's just sad.

36:10.085 --> 36:12.920
I solved this when I stayed up
studying last night.

36:12.921 --> 36:14.214
Hadam.

36:14.964 --> 36:18.300
In baseball, throwing pull power
every time will strain your body.

36:18.301 --> 36:20.594
You need a breather to grow stronger.

36:20.595 --> 36:22.138
A breather?

36:23.473 --> 36:24.474
That's why…

36:27.352 --> 36:28.478
you need a breather now.

36:30.271 --> 36:32.524
All right. Pitcher Cha Yougyum
is ready to throw.

36:38.405 --> 36:39.530
I hit it!

36:39.531 --> 36:40.907
Run, Hadam!

36:42.242 --> 36:43.617
Go!

36:48.873 --> 36:49.958
Right.

36:53.545 --> 36:56.965
Yougyum always understood me.

37:04.597 --> 37:07.350
Nabong, guess what I found?

37:16.651 --> 37:19.611
Manjae, where did you get that photo?

37:19.612 --> 37:20.738
Oh.

37:20.739 --> 37:22.740
I was organizing my vinyl collection,

37:22.741 --> 37:25.701
and it just fell out.

37:25.702 --> 37:28.871
I can't believe it.
That was such a long time ago.

37:28.872 --> 37:30.457
I wonder if that tree is still there.

37:31.416 --> 37:36.171
Remember the tteokbokki place
we used to go to in the market?

37:36.588 --> 37:37.755
What was it called?

37:37.756 --> 37:39.965
- Ah! Fat Tteokbokki.
- Fat Tteokbokki.

37:39.966 --> 37:41.842
Right?

37:43.344 --> 37:46.431
Ah… I'm craving
that super sweet tteokbokki.

37:47.182 --> 37:50.185
Do you want to go
have tteokbokki this evening?

37:51.853 --> 37:53.437
No…

37:53.438 --> 37:55.898
You shouldn't ditch work, right?

37:55.899 --> 37:57.524
Come on.

37:57.525 --> 38:00.779
Nabong, have you forgotten
that I'm the owner?

38:01.821 --> 38:03.697
I can totally ditch work.

38:05.575 --> 38:06.700
Well, well.

38:06.701 --> 38:09.286
I caught you. Are you ditching work?

38:09.287 --> 38:11.038
No, I'm receiving an award.

38:11.039 --> 38:13.373
Oh, right. The Fashion Awards is today.

38:13.374 --> 38:15.250
Congratulations.

38:15.251 --> 38:16.544
See you.

38:24.719 --> 38:26.261
Love.

38:26.262 --> 38:29.181
That means you like him too.

38:29.182 --> 38:31.058
No way.

38:31.059 --> 38:32.142
Was he right?

38:32.143 --> 38:35.437
Why does he look so cool
when he's just walking?

38:40.568 --> 38:42.319
Why am I blushing?

38:42.320 --> 38:43.863
And why am I sweating?

38:51.079 --> 38:53.413
Are you free this evening?

38:53.414 --> 38:55.917
This evening?
Not morning or afternoon?

38:56.543 --> 38:59.044
Is he asking me out?

38:59.045 --> 39:01.004
On a date?

39:01.005 --> 39:03.173
I got a reply that the factory

39:03.174 --> 39:05.717
couldn't get any of the bio silk
you talked about.

39:05.718 --> 39:07.010
I did more research

39:07.011 --> 39:10.681
and got in touch with an industry
tech reporter who wrote about it.

39:10.682 --> 39:12.558
We're meeting this evening.

39:12.559 --> 39:14.893
We may find a way to do it.

39:14.894 --> 39:18.147
Mr. Yeon's cheeks
seem a little red, too.

39:18.648 --> 39:20.941
Huh? And he's sweating.

39:20.942 --> 39:22.276
Was Raemee really right?

39:22.277 --> 39:25.238
Then we really like each other?

39:28.283 --> 39:30.994
Great job with the meeting.

39:34.706 --> 39:36.206
How about some wine?

39:36.207 --> 39:37.542
Just you and me,

39:38.126 --> 39:39.168
alone.

39:40.003 --> 39:42.046
Sure. I'd like that.

39:42.630 --> 39:44.257
Pardon? Uh…

39:44.883 --> 39:47.093
Are you saying you'll come?

39:48.928 --> 39:50.262
Ah.

39:50.263 --> 39:52.306
Yes, I'm free.

39:52.307 --> 39:54.308
I'll drive, then.

39:54.309 --> 39:56.519
I'll see you at the parking lot
at 7:00 p.m.

40:03.693 --> 40:05.987
Why are we meeting at 7:00 p.m.?

40:07.655 --> 40:09.156
Right.

40:09.157 --> 40:10.199
The new material.

40:11.534 --> 40:12.618
The meeting.

40:12.619 --> 40:14.036
GYUM'S LAUNDRY

40:14.037 --> 40:15.580
I'm home.

40:18.666 --> 40:19.958
Mom.

40:19.959 --> 40:22.294
Mom, I must have lost my mind.

40:22.295 --> 40:25.757
I miss Hadam so much,
I must be hallucinating.

40:27.467 --> 40:29.468
But…

40:29.469 --> 40:32.346
it's still so nice to see her.

40:37.894 --> 40:39.062
You idiot.

40:39.979 --> 40:41.230
It's really me.

40:41.856 --> 40:43.315
Wow.

40:43.316 --> 40:44.484
She's even talking now.

40:45.234 --> 40:48.946
I must have gone crazy
from missing her so much.

40:48.947 --> 40:50.365
You idiot.

40:51.783 --> 40:53.451
It really is me.

40:54.953 --> 40:58.205
Is it really you?

40:58.206 --> 41:00.207
You're really Hadam?

41:00.208 --> 41:02.793
I didn't give Seokhyeon my number.

41:02.794 --> 41:06.672
Someone left a drink at my seat
with a heart post-it,

41:06.673 --> 41:09.008
and I rushed out thinking it was from you.

41:09.467 --> 41:12.011
When I heard it was from Seokhyeon,
I gave it back to him.

41:16.224 --> 41:17.225
Really?

41:17.850 --> 41:19.143
I'm sorry I misunderstood.

41:19.727 --> 41:21.687
I wasn't having fun at karaoke either.

41:21.688 --> 41:23.940
My friends took me there to comfort me,

41:24.524 --> 41:26.692
but I just kept crying
at the thought of you.

41:26.693 --> 41:28.778
I'm sorry I misunderstood you, too.

41:29.862 --> 41:32.490
But why are you wearing glasses?

41:32.991 --> 41:34.367
Has your eyesight gotten bad?

41:34.909 --> 41:35.910
No,

41:37.286 --> 41:38.662
I don't need them now.

41:38.663 --> 41:41.457
And you? Why were you
at the nurse's office? Were you sick?

41:44.168 --> 41:45.920
I just got a small cut on my hand,

41:46.671 --> 41:48.297
but I'm all better now.

41:57.015 --> 41:58.682
I'm sorry, Hadam.

41:58.683 --> 42:01.059
I'm more sorry.

42:01.060 --> 42:02.894
I missed you so much.

42:02.895 --> 42:05.731
I missed you even more.

42:05.732 --> 42:08.817
The Best Designer Award.

42:08.818 --> 42:11.278
Nana Atelier, Song Haran.

42:11.279 --> 42:13.238
There are two winners this year.

42:13.239 --> 42:15.699
Onne Apparel, Kang Eunchan.

42:27.628 --> 42:28.629
Haran.

42:29.088 --> 42:31.715
I have to go to the factory.
There's a fabric issue.

42:31.716 --> 42:34.218
I booked a table at Haeon,
the restaurant nearby.

42:35.470 --> 42:36.595
Take this and go there.

42:36.596 --> 42:40.348
I said I'd buy dinner for my brother,
but I can't let him eat alone.

42:40.349 --> 42:42.769
Sorry, but just have dinner
with him, okay?

42:44.145 --> 42:46.855
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

42:46.856 --> 42:48.940
♪ Happy birthday… ♪

42:50.985 --> 42:54.362
I'm sorry. I haven't slept
for the past three days.

42:54.363 --> 42:56.364
Sorry. Right.

42:56.365 --> 42:57.991
♪ Happy birthday, dear… ♪

42:57.992 --> 42:59.493
Kang Hyeokchan.

42:59.494 --> 43:01.453
♪ Kang Hyeokchan ♪

43:01.454 --> 43:03.330
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

43:08.169 --> 43:10.797
A Mr. Kang from our house
asked me to give it to you.

43:11.255 --> 43:12.799
- What?
- Good luck.

43:13.466 --> 43:14.925
VITAMINS FOR ENERGY
A CUSHION FOR A NAP

43:14.926 --> 43:16.510
CHOCOLATE AFTER LUNCH
CHAMOMILE AFTER WORK

43:16.511 --> 43:17.553
WITH THESE, YOU CAN SLEEP BETTER

43:26.020 --> 43:27.230
- I love you.
- Hmm?

43:28.231 --> 43:29.315
That's so sudden.

43:35.321 --> 43:36.322
It's work.

43:37.406 --> 43:39.200
Good luck with the embassy interview.

43:42.578 --> 43:43.621
Hello?

43:43.955 --> 43:47.207
I can't believe I have to work
when you're leaving.

43:47.208 --> 43:48.543
I'm so sorry, Chan.

43:49.252 --> 43:50.585
It's fine.

43:50.586 --> 43:52.921
I told you I won't get upset
about you being busy.

43:52.922 --> 43:55.090
I'll be back during vacation. I love you.

43:55.091 --> 43:56.424
I'm so sorry.

43:56.425 --> 43:58.094
Leave me a message when you arrive.

43:59.470 --> 44:03.014
I can't go back to Korea
because of my lab schedule.

44:03.015 --> 44:05.935
And my phone's broken,
so I won't be able to text for a while.

44:06.602 --> 44:08.770
Leave me a message
if there's anything urgent.

44:08.771 --> 44:10.439
I knew it.

44:10.898 --> 44:12.817
Are you sure he just doesn't want to come?

44:13.317 --> 44:15.819
- What?
- Well, I haven't seen it myself,

44:15.820 --> 44:18.530
but he was so nice to you
when he was in Seoul.

44:18.531 --> 44:21.324
But you were always busy
and didn't keep in touch often.

44:21.325 --> 44:23.034
You didn't even show much affection.

44:23.035 --> 44:24.744
You'll get dumped at this rate.

44:24.745 --> 44:27.415
You're right.
I guess I deserve it.

44:28.416 --> 44:29.708
That's too bad.

44:29.709 --> 44:31.877
What's that reaction?

44:31.878 --> 44:33.879
Do you even like Hyeokchan?

44:33.880 --> 44:36.506
Of course I do. He's my boyfriend.

44:36.507 --> 44:38.217
No, not like that.

44:38.801 --> 44:40.052
Do you love him?

44:40.678 --> 44:41.679
Mmm?

44:42.221 --> 44:43.638
Did Chan send that?

44:43.639 --> 44:45.892
He sent a drawing pen
for his designer girlfriend?

44:46.976 --> 44:49.812
Wow. And even with your name
engraved on it?

44:51.939 --> 44:54.941
But how did you come up
with the idea of sending me a pen?

44:56.360 --> 44:58.820
I KEPT THINKING ABOUT HOW YOU SAID
YOU FELT LIKE YOU WERE TRAPPED

44:58.821 --> 45:00.864
I GUESS I WANTED THAT PEN
TO BE THAT "IF" FOR YOU

45:02.491 --> 45:05.161
Chan understands me so well…

45:05.828 --> 45:06.829
SORRY, I WAS RAMBLING

45:07.788 --> 45:11.417
I miss you, Hyeokchan.

45:12.752 --> 45:15.504
Ta-da! I'm at the airport!

45:15.630 --> 45:17.715
I wanted to tell you something in person.

45:18.090 --> 45:20.218
Chan. I love you.

45:21.719 --> 45:23.887
I love you, Chan.

45:23.888 --> 45:25.347
Haran, what do I do?

45:25.348 --> 45:26.349
Chan…

45:26.849 --> 45:29.477
Hyeokchan is dead.

45:42.323 --> 45:44.116
I moved to Onne Apparel.

45:45.326 --> 45:48.788
It's awkward giving you my business card.

45:52.208 --> 45:54.126
Have you been well?

45:56.587 --> 45:57.755
It's already been…

45:58.881 --> 45:59.882
seven years.

46:01.217 --> 46:03.970
I always wondered how you were doing,

46:04.512 --> 46:06.180
but I felt too guilty to contact you.

46:06.931 --> 46:09.725
Why would you feel guilty?

46:18.067 --> 46:19.944
- What is it?
- Oh…

46:21.320 --> 46:24.614
Were you getting checkups here?

46:24.615 --> 46:25.616
Huh?

46:26.534 --> 46:28.368
Ahh.

46:28.369 --> 46:31.746
I was at a different ER
when I collapsed last time.

46:33.124 --> 46:35.709
I got a referral, so I come here.

46:35.710 --> 46:36.960
It's closer.

46:36.961 --> 46:38.296
- What is it?
- Ah…

46:39.005 --> 46:42.550
I got treated here before.

46:43.509 --> 46:46.429
I'll go ask where we can get the results.

46:52.560 --> 46:54.103
We have to go to the annex.

46:54.729 --> 46:55.813
Really?

46:56.772 --> 46:59.025
But why are you dressed up today?

47:00.192 --> 47:01.484
Hmm?

47:01.485 --> 47:04.780
I have to be dressed up
to go somewhere later.

47:05.364 --> 47:07.365
Mmm…

47:07.366 --> 47:08.534
Where are you going?

47:14.040 --> 47:15.123
The door is closing.

47:15.124 --> 47:17.460
The door is closing.

47:34.060 --> 47:36.854
Huh? Hey, roomie!

47:57.833 --> 47:58.834
Mr. Park.

48:00.169 --> 48:02.838
Sorry, I'll head over there.

48:05.383 --> 48:06.384
Okay.

48:12.681 --> 48:15.558
Visiting neurology resident
from Boston General Hospital,

48:15.559 --> 48:16.727
Cha Sujin.

48:17.269 --> 48:18.561
I'm Cha Sujin.

48:18.562 --> 48:20.730
I'll do my best
to learn as much as I can here.

48:20.731 --> 48:22.525
Nice to meet you all.

48:27.530 --> 48:28.780
Dr. Cha.

48:28.781 --> 48:30.365
You shouldn't wear accessories here.

48:30.366 --> 48:33.619
Sorry. I forgot to take it off.

48:35.121 --> 48:37.580
MEDICAL STAFF SEARCH

48:37.581 --> 48:40.459
LEE SUJIN

48:41.627 --> 48:43.421
I'm sure she was in a gown.

48:51.512 --> 48:52.513
All right.

48:53.139 --> 48:54.931
I got the results.

48:54.932 --> 48:58.269
But why did you suddenly get off earlier?

48:58.978 --> 49:00.979
Oh. It was nothing.

49:00.980 --> 49:02.689
There's a convenience store nearby.

49:02.690 --> 49:04.441
I'll go buy some drinks for the nurses.

49:04.442 --> 49:05.943
Mmm.

49:06.902 --> 49:09.071
Hmm? They didn't say it was going to rain.

49:09.530 --> 49:10.697
Is it a shower?

49:10.698 --> 49:12.991
I have a hood, so it's fine.
I'll be back soon.

49:12.992 --> 49:14.326
Okay.

49:19.915 --> 49:22.041
Who's that? Your friend?

49:22.042 --> 49:23.711
No, just my roommate.

49:27.173 --> 49:29.925
Dr. Cha, we're starting rounds.

49:30.551 --> 49:31.552
Okay.

49:34.722 --> 49:35.806
Hospitalized?

49:36.515 --> 49:38.642
- Hyeokchan?
-  Don't you remember?

49:39.226 --> 49:41.728
He hurt his hand badly in the lab.

49:41.729 --> 49:42.980
He even got surgery.

49:43.939 --> 49:45.024
A surgery?

49:45.816 --> 49:48.443
I never heard anything about that.

49:51.447 --> 49:52.864
Manjae, what do you think?

49:52.865 --> 49:55.867
It looks like
Genius' paw print. It's cute.

49:55.868 --> 49:57.410
- Right?
- Should I buy it for you?

49:57.411 --> 49:59.537
- Sure.
- Okay. How much is it?

49:59.538 --> 50:00.914
- Manjae!
- What? What is it?

50:00.915 --> 50:02.207
Tteokbokki! Tteokbokki!

50:08.547 --> 50:10.382
It's good.

50:11.008 --> 50:14.219
Having tteokbokki after ditching
is the best.

50:14.220 --> 50:15.303
Right?

50:15.304 --> 50:18.056
That only applies
to the Chuncheon fashionista Nabong.

50:18.057 --> 50:20.184
I never ditched school.

50:20.809 --> 50:23.603
Ah. Right, of course.

50:23.604 --> 50:26.940
You were the bookworm Park Manjae.

50:26.941 --> 50:28.691
That's right.

50:30.277 --> 50:31.320
Excuse me.

50:31.862 --> 50:34.405
Are you Kim Nana, by any chance?

50:34.406 --> 50:35.698
It seems like it, right?

50:35.699 --> 50:37.617
We're fashion design majors,

50:37.618 --> 50:39.953
and we're huge fans.

50:39.954 --> 50:41.913
Could I have an autograph?

50:41.914 --> 50:45.291
Mmm… Oh, dear. My face is my autograph.

50:45.292 --> 50:47.669
You can take a selfie with me.

50:47.670 --> 50:50.172
One, two, three.

50:50.923 --> 50:53.132
Thank you.

50:53.133 --> 50:56.219
By the way, your husband is freaking…

50:56.220 --> 50:58.137
I mean, he's really cool.

50:58.138 --> 51:00.057
- No, I'm…
- He's freaking cool, isn't he?

51:00.683 --> 51:03.017
I care about looks.

51:13.028 --> 51:15.405
Why do I feel so nervous
being alone with him?

51:15.406 --> 51:17.240
Oh… I feel so hot.

51:17.241 --> 51:20.368
Should I turn off the heater?
Would it show that I'm nervous?

51:20.369 --> 51:22.704
It's hot.

51:29.420 --> 51:30.504
Should I close the window?

51:31.130 --> 51:32.965
No, it's fine. You can do as you like.

51:42.308 --> 51:44.934
Then would it be possible to get samples?

51:44.935 --> 51:48.354
Yes, but it's over five times
the price of silk,

51:48.355 --> 51:50.356
and the durability tests
aren't stable yet.

51:50.357 --> 51:52.568
That's why I want to try this.

51:53.110 --> 51:54.360
I want to make clothes

51:54.361 --> 51:56.530
not just for display
but to prove the future.

51:56.989 --> 51:59.741
I really want to achieve that
for our brand.

51:59.742 --> 52:01.618
You seem very determined.

52:01.619 --> 52:03.953
How should we get the samples?

52:03.954 --> 52:06.289
There's a research facility
I came in touch with.

52:06.290 --> 52:08.917
It's a bio startup company.
I'll give you their number.

52:09.460 --> 52:10.753
- Really?
-  Yes.

52:11.253 --> 52:15.131
And I'll ask them again
for their cooperation.

52:15.132 --> 52:17.091
Thank you…

52:17.092 --> 52:18.301
I was just so grateful.

52:18.302 --> 52:20.720
- Are you all right?
-  Yes.

52:20.721 --> 52:22.722
- You really mean it?
- Of course.

52:22.723 --> 52:24.807
- Ms. Song, here's my business card.
- Ah.

52:24.808 --> 52:26.601
Contact me if you have any questions.

52:26.602 --> 52:27.810
Thank you.

52:27.811 --> 52:29.437
It was nice seeing you again, Taeseok.

52:29.438 --> 52:32.440
What? Do you two know each other?

52:32.441 --> 52:33.776
Why didn't you tell me?

52:34.360 --> 52:37.445
I'm actually his junior from college.

52:37.446 --> 52:38.655
He asked me

52:38.656 --> 52:40.616
to keep it a secret
in case you felt uneasy.

52:41.450 --> 52:44.495
I tried to get close to him,
but he never let me back then.

52:44.953 --> 52:46.079
And now--

52:46.080 --> 52:48.164
Thank you for today, Mr. Chae.

52:48.165 --> 52:49.416
I'll see you next time.

52:49.958 --> 52:51.168
You haven't changed a bit.

52:53.170 --> 52:56.631
I'd like to get to know you better.

52:56.632 --> 52:58.842
How about a glass of wine together?

52:59.468 --> 53:00.844
Just the two of us.

53:01.345 --> 53:04.556
Just the two of us?

53:05.140 --> 53:06.141
That's okay, right?

53:06.975 --> 53:09.144
I don't think it's my place
to say yes or no.

53:10.062 --> 53:11.063
Then excuse me.

53:13.941 --> 53:15.566
What was that?

53:15.567 --> 53:17.611
Did he just set me up on a date?

53:18.028 --> 53:19.613
Didn't he have feelings for me?

53:20.906 --> 53:21.990
Mr. Yeon.

53:22.533 --> 53:25.577
Is it really okay for me
to have a drink with him, alone?

53:26.203 --> 53:28.204
Why are you asking me that?

53:28.205 --> 53:30.248
I think it's your business.

53:31.667 --> 53:33.419
Ah. Fine.

53:37.297 --> 53:40.007
Mr. Chae, let's go have some wine.

53:40.008 --> 53:41.760
I'm really craving a drink today.

53:51.478 --> 53:53.813
Hadam, enjoy these dishes.

53:53.814 --> 53:56.566
You even packed side dishes for me?

53:56.567 --> 53:57.817
Thank you.

53:57.818 --> 53:59.777
Make sure to visit after the CSAT.

53:59.778 --> 54:01.238
I promise I will.

54:02.281 --> 54:05.075
But could you give me

54:06.577 --> 54:07.994
one more hug?

54:07.995 --> 54:10.329
Of course, I can. Come here.

54:12.958 --> 54:14.917
I'll see you again later. Hmm?

54:14.918 --> 54:16.043
Okay.

54:16.044 --> 54:18.588
- Me too. I want a hug, too.
- My goodness!

54:18.589 --> 54:21.132
Then I should join as well.

54:25.721 --> 54:29.307
A surgery?
I never heard anything about that.

54:29.308 --> 54:30.768
You didn't know?

54:31.435 --> 54:34.730
I guess Chan didn't tell you
in case you got worried.

54:39.318 --> 54:41.778
Excuse me.

54:41.779 --> 54:46.116
You're Designer Song Haran
who won the Best Designer Award, right?

54:46.950 --> 54:49.202
Oh? How are you here?

54:49.203 --> 54:52.122
I have a habit of congratulating people
who receive awards.

54:52.998 --> 54:54.291
Here.

54:54.791 --> 54:55.875
Congratulations.

54:58.420 --> 54:59.463
Thanks.

55:00.547 --> 55:03.634
But why do you look so down

55:04.218 --> 55:05.594
when you just won an award?

55:06.261 --> 55:08.346
No, I'm really happy.

55:08.347 --> 55:10.474
No, your expression looks…

55:11.975 --> 55:13.727
like this.

55:14.436 --> 55:16.938
Let's go.

55:16.939 --> 55:18.106
Go where?

55:18.899 --> 55:20.692
Photos? That's so random.

55:21.527 --> 55:23.319
I told you, what you took doesn't count.

55:23.320 --> 55:24.946
Oh. This one's good.

55:24.947 --> 55:26.281
All right. Come here.

55:29.993 --> 55:32.162
Our Best Designer.

55:34.498 --> 55:36.917
Okay. One, two, three.

55:39.419 --> 55:40.587
You should smile.

55:41.421 --> 55:42.755
This time with the flowers.

55:42.756 --> 55:43.757
Here. Smile.

55:45.342 --> 55:47.386
All right. One, two, three.

55:48.303 --> 55:51.180
I'll do an ugly face for you
to make you look prettier.

55:51.181 --> 55:53.141
One, two, three.

55:57.354 --> 55:59.064
Pretty pose.

56:00.440 --> 56:02.484
Look at your expressions.

56:05.153 --> 56:07.154
- Let's go to our next course.
- What?

56:07.155 --> 56:09.241
Where? Where are we going?

56:10.701 --> 56:12.369
Come on, let's go.

56:13.161 --> 56:14.162
This way.

56:17.416 --> 56:20.544
Wow. You came to such
a nice place alone? Tsk.

56:21.086 --> 56:23.171
You're the one
who disappeared without telling me.

56:25.632 --> 56:28.009
Excuse me, could you take a picture of us?

56:28.010 --> 56:29.844
Sure, of course.

56:29.845 --> 56:31.722
Two, three.

56:32.306 --> 56:34.348
- Thank you.
-  Thank you.

56:34.349 --> 56:36.310
Would you like a photo, too?

56:37.519 --> 56:38.853
Sure.

56:38.854 --> 56:41.397
Okay. Smile.

56:41.398 --> 56:43.441
It'll look nice
if you smile at each other.

56:43.442 --> 56:45.485
- Can you look at each other?
- Like this?

56:49.615 --> 56:51.199
What should I do?

56:52.075 --> 56:54.493
I'll do an ugly face for you.

56:54.494 --> 56:56.663
- We'll take one for you, too.
- Oh, I'm okay.

57:01.918 --> 57:03.128
Thank you.

57:05.714 --> 57:07.173
I'll take it now.

57:07.174 --> 57:09.092
One, two, three.

57:15.474 --> 57:18.727
There's a blanket I've been using
since I was a baby,

57:19.645 --> 57:21.688
and it had this distinctive scent.

57:23.523 --> 57:27.027
It felt warm and comforting

57:28.779 --> 57:30.947
and made me feel like I'm going to cry.

57:33.533 --> 57:35.661
But that scent disappeared.

57:36.328 --> 57:38.538
It smelled just like my mom used to.

57:40.415 --> 57:42.334
But when your mom hugged me earlier,

57:44.753 --> 57:46.003
I smelled the same scent.

57:53.261 --> 57:54.471
So I ended up crying.

57:56.139 --> 57:58.225
I thought it was the smell of detergent,

57:59.434 --> 58:01.103
but I guess that was the scent of a mom.

58:03.939 --> 58:06.441
Oh? Then wouldn't I smell similar?

58:07.734 --> 58:08.735
Try smelling me.

58:14.241 --> 58:16.326
You have a different scent.

58:18.078 --> 58:20.663
I'm going to marry you, no matter what.

58:20.664 --> 58:21.789
What?

58:21.790 --> 58:24.041
Whenever I see you,

58:24.042 --> 58:27.086
I wonder how you could be so wonderful.

58:27.087 --> 58:29.089
But I understood when I saw your parents.

58:29.673 --> 58:31.967
If they become my family,

58:32.551 --> 58:34.177
I'll be so happy.

58:36.221 --> 58:38.014
Still, I'll love you the most.

58:39.599 --> 58:40.642
What do I do?

58:41.268 --> 58:44.812
I'm so happy,
I feel like I'm going to faint.

58:44.813 --> 58:48.107
There's nothing left
but happiness for us.

58:48.108 --> 58:49.234
Mm.

58:50.402 --> 58:52.695
Let's go. I want to study.

58:52.696 --> 58:53.947
Okay.

58:55.073 --> 58:56.408
The minimum CSAT requirement?

58:57.117 --> 58:59.077
It's going to be a piece of cake.

59:02.664 --> 59:04.039
Why aren't you coming?

59:05.751 --> 59:07.377
Did you really faint?

59:08.462 --> 59:10.922
Come on. Stop fooling around.

59:12.591 --> 59:14.968
Hadam, what do I do?

59:18.180 --> 59:20.474
I can't get up.

59:21.057 --> 59:22.141
My foot…

59:22.142 --> 59:23.225
What?

59:27.564 --> 59:29.316
Huh?

59:36.948 --> 59:38.032
Yougyum…

59:39.618 --> 59:41.202
Thank you for the umbrella.

59:44.122 --> 59:45.582
See you.

59:46.291 --> 59:47.500
-  Yes!
-  Bye.

59:47.501 --> 59:48.667
Sure. Bye.

59:48.668 --> 59:49.960
- Bye.
- Get home safely.

59:49.961 --> 59:50.962
Okay.

59:52.506 --> 59:56.259
Tsk. He made me
get my hopes up for nothing.

59:58.553 --> 01:00:00.806
I should thank him.

01:00:01.389 --> 01:00:04.935
I'm so grateful that he introduced us.

01:00:09.981 --> 01:00:11.107
Why isn't he picking up?

01:00:16.696 --> 01:00:20.867
Mr. Yeon, I had so much fun
with Mr. Chae today…

01:00:22.536 --> 01:00:23.828
What are you spying on?

01:00:23.829 --> 01:00:25.580
Gosh, you scared me.

01:00:26.581 --> 01:00:29.667
Did Mr. Yeon not come back here
after the meeting?

01:00:29.668 --> 01:00:31.461
He just dropped by for a bit and left.

01:00:32.128 --> 01:00:33.212
Ah.

01:00:33.213 --> 01:00:34.381
You'd better buy me lunch…

01:00:34.840 --> 01:00:37.384
for the information.

01:00:38.844 --> 01:00:41.095
He always gets off work late, though.

01:00:41.096 --> 01:00:42.305
Mr. Yeon Taeseok?

01:00:43.515 --> 01:00:44.891
There's a delivery for you.

01:00:45.559 --> 01:00:47.309
I'll take that.

01:00:47.310 --> 01:00:48.936
Thank you.

01:00:48.937 --> 01:00:51.022
YEON TAESEOK

01:00:57.863 --> 01:00:59.531
Mr. Yeon.

01:01:04.411 --> 01:01:06.496
What? He's not home, either?

01:01:10.917 --> 01:01:12.752
Mr. Yeon, I…

01:01:14.004 --> 01:01:15.087
Oh?

01:01:17.424 --> 01:01:18.716
What…

01:01:18.717 --> 01:01:20.302
What's going on?

01:01:23.930 --> 01:01:27.767
This keychain is so cute.

01:01:28.268 --> 01:01:30.979
Manjae, let's go have sujebi next time.

01:01:32.397 --> 01:01:35.524
And let's visit Chuncheon as well
before it gets colder.

01:01:35.525 --> 01:01:36.985
- Let's…
- Kim Nabong.

01:01:38.320 --> 01:01:39.445
What?

01:01:39.446 --> 01:01:40.447
Why aren't you coming?

01:01:41.781 --> 01:01:42.866
You.

01:01:45.201 --> 01:01:46.578
Where are you going this time?

01:01:47.203 --> 01:01:48.621
I said let's go to Chuncheon.

01:01:48.622 --> 01:01:51.040
You're behaving just like back then.

01:01:51.041 --> 01:01:53.918
When you suddenly left for France
when you were 20,

01:01:53.919 --> 01:01:55.210
you acted just like this.

01:01:55.211 --> 01:01:57.838
You called me out of the blue

01:01:57.839 --> 01:02:00.216
and said, "Let's do this. Let's go here."

01:02:00.967 --> 01:02:03.928
Then you suddenly disappeared
without saying anything.

01:02:06.932 --> 01:02:09.850
That was a long time ago. Don't be silly.

01:02:09.851 --> 01:02:10.894
Tell me.

01:02:11.728 --> 01:02:13.021
What is it this time?

01:02:13.480 --> 01:02:15.231
What on earth is going on with you?

01:02:30.664 --> 01:02:31.790
Hello?

01:02:33.500 --> 01:02:35.627
Yes. May I ask who's calling?

01:02:44.636 --> 01:02:45.886
Oh…

01:02:45.887 --> 01:02:47.221
All right.

01:02:47.222 --> 01:02:48.723
I'll go and check.

01:02:58.650 --> 01:03:00.694
Ah.

01:03:06.741 --> 01:03:09.703
I miss you already.

01:03:14.374 --> 01:03:16.501
- Hmm?
-  Can you come out for a bit?

01:03:22.841 --> 01:03:25.343
That was fast, wasn't it?

01:03:25.844 --> 01:03:26.886
Aren't you tired?

01:03:27.387 --> 01:03:29.930
I mean, I told you to go home and rest,

01:03:29.931 --> 01:03:30.932
but…

01:03:31.641 --> 01:03:35.894
I was actually really sad
that you left.

01:03:38.815 --> 01:03:39.816
What is it?

01:03:40.483 --> 01:03:41.735
Is something wrong?

01:03:42.569 --> 01:03:45.696
I just got a call from the restaurant.

01:03:45.697 --> 01:03:47.157
What restaurant?

01:04:00.962 --> 01:04:03.965
I think you owe me an explanation.

01:04:29.074 --> 01:04:31.116
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:04:55.141 --> 01:04:59.728
It sounds like
they're not meant to be together.

01:04:59.729 --> 01:05:03.315
Can you tell me what you know
about what happened seven years ago?

01:05:03.316 --> 01:05:05.567
I'll tell her everything

01:05:05.568 --> 01:05:08.278
and apologize to her.

01:05:08.279 --> 01:05:12.658
The chance
of Ms. Song and I dating is zero.

01:05:12.659 --> 01:05:17.371
Am I really just mistaken
about all those situations?

01:05:17.372 --> 01:05:19.957
It's rare to find
someone who makes you smile.

01:05:19.958 --> 01:05:22.000
What if you're not okay?

01:05:22.001 --> 01:05:23.627
What if something else happens?

01:05:23.628 --> 01:05:26.213
I want to stay by her side,

01:05:26.214 --> 01:05:28.007
but I don't know what to do.

01:05:40.353 --> 01:05:41.436
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:05:41.437 --> 01:05:42.438
Translated by Juyoung Park
